---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How we collect, use, and protect your data at Lantle.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Effective Date: September 2026</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section prose fade-in">
    <p>At <strong>{SITE.name}</strong>, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy governs our data collection, processing, and usage practices. It also describes your choices regarding use, access, and correction of your personal information.</p>
    
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information in the following ways:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information You Provide to Us:</strong> When you fill out forms on our website (such as contact forms, newsletter subscriptions, or tool submissions), we collect the personal information you explicitly provide. This includes your name, email address, company name, and the content of your message.</li>
      <li><strong>Automatically Collected Information:</strong> We use privacy-first analytics tools that do not use cookies or collect personally identifiable information (PII). Our analytics measure aggregate website traffic to help us improve user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information we collect only in compliance with this Privacy Policy. We may use your personal information to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide, operate, and maintain our website and services.</li>
      <li>Process your tool submissions and feature requests.</li>
      <li>Respond to your comments, questions, and provide customer support.</li>
      <li>Send you transactional emails, such as order confirmations and billing updates.</li>
      <li>Send you marketing communications, such as our newsletter, if you have opted in (you may unsubscribe at any time).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p>We use essential cookies to ensure our website functions correctly. We do not use first-party tracking cookies for marketing or surveillance.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Strictly Necessary Cookies:</strong> These cookies are essential for the website to function, such as securely processing payments.</li>
      <li><strong>Third-Party Services:</strong> We use carefully vetted third-party service providers (such as Dodo Payments for secure checkout, and Google Fonts for typography) which may set their own cookies and log IP addresses in accordance with their respective privacy policies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties. We only share data with service providers that help us operate our business (e.g., payment processors and cloud hosting providers) under strict confidentiality agreements. For example, payments are securely processed by Dodo Payments, and we never have access to your raw credit card details.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We use appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect the personal information that we collect and process about you. While no internet transmission is fully secure, we utilize industry-standard encryption, secure hosting environments (Cloudflare, Heroku), and strict access controls.</p>

    <h2>6. Your Data Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request access to the personal data we hold about you.</li>
      <li>Request that we correct any inaccurate personal data.</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your personal data ("Right to be Forgotten").</li>
      <li>Opt out of marketing communications at any time by clicking the "unsubscribe" link in our emails.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise any of these rights, please email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We aim to respond to all requests within 7 business days.</p>

    <h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. The "Effective Date" at the top of this page indicates when the latest changes were published.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
